    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/4aba2761cdf6f70b7f593394237eecde.poster.avif?t=1746713051\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/4aba2761cdf6f70b7f593394237eecde.webm?t=1746713051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/4aba2761cdf6f70b7f593394237eecde.mp4?t=1746713051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Intellica   believes\u00a0that positivity and happiness are the keys to self-sustaining thinking programs.\u00a0By taking part in the A.M.T. Study, you can help make it happen!</strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QUALIA</strong> is a retro-inspired Interactive Fiction text game where you analyze and categorize two participants based on their responses to a series of questions. Are they really human? Are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember,\u00a0the A.M.T.\u00a0Study is not a measurement of intelligence, but a questionnaire designed to determine the ability of an AI to be able to convincingly appear as a human. It is up to you to decide whether or not the participants are Human or Artificial.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/e32cff03b65ed3846aef5d5c064ef957.poster.avif?t=1746713051\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/e32cff03b65ed3846aef5d5c064ef957.webm?t=1746713051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>featuring...</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 endings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 20,000 words!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 300 possible unique playthroughs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >audio visual media to satisfy your senses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the weight of extreme existential dread!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >clinically insane levels of world-building for a short text-based game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >retro aesthetic for anyone born before 1984 to feel nostalgic for!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >educational lore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one jumpscare!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ambition far beyond the dev's reasonable means!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/1abe25e9965e758ec210e9552d287939.avif?t=1746713051\" width=265 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(:</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/4aba2761cdf6f70b7f593394237eecde.poster.avif?t=1746713051\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/4aba2761cdf6f70b7f593394237eecde.webm?t=1746713051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/4aba2761cdf6f70b7f593394237eecde.mp4?t=1746713051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Intellica   believes\u00a0that positivity and happiness are the keys to self-sustaining thinking programs.\u00a0By taking part in the A.M.T. Study, you can help make it happen!</strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QUALIA</strong> is a retro-inspired Interactive Fiction text game where you analyze and categorize two participants based on their responses to a series of questions. Are they really human? Are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember,\u00a0the A.M.T.\u00a0Study is not a measurement of intelligence, but a questionnaire designed to determine the ability of an AI to be able to convincingly appear as a human. It is up to you to decide whether or not the participants are Human or Artificial.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/e32cff03b65ed3846aef5d5c064ef957.poster.avif?t=1746713051\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/e32cff03b65ed3846aef5d5c064ef957.webm?t=1746713051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>featuring...</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 endings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 20,000 words!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 300 possible unique playthroughs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >audio visual media to satisfy your senses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the weight of extreme existential dread!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >clinically insane levels of world-building for a short text-based game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >retro aesthetic for anyone born before 1984 to feel nostalgic for!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >educational lore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one jumpscare!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ambition far beyond the dev's reasonable means!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/1abe25e9965e758ec210e9552d287939.avif?t=1746713051\" width=265 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(:</p>",
    "short_description": "Intellica thanks you for volunteering in this short text-based Research Study. Pay attention to the participants answers, and classify them as either Human or Artificial. Join us in shaping the future of technology. Remember, think happy!",
